{
  "slug": "cc-suite",
  "name": "Cc Suite",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "cc-suite turns three CLI tools (Claude Code, OpenAI Codex CLI, Google Gemini CLI) into one shared brain. Project context is written once in AGENTS.md; CLAUDE.md and GEMINI.md just `@AGENTS.md` to import it. Skills live in `.claude/skills/` and `.agents/skills/` symlinks to it, so the same skill works in all three CLIs. Hooks defined for Claude Code are mirrored into Codex's hook system. MCP servers in .mcp.json are visible to all three. The Claude↔Codex delegation lane is bidirectional: from Claude, /cc-suite:audit, :implement, :verify, :review, :bug-analyze, and :review-plan all hand work to Codex and return structured results. Supersedes the separate cc-bridge and codex-toolkit plugins.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **39 commands** and **3 hooks**.\n\n- **Commands** (39): `add-agent` (Create a new cc-suite advisor agent — a project-scoped value-over-rules persona registered as an MCP server for Claude…), `agy-preflight` (Check Antigravity CLI (agy) availability, authentication, models, and workspace MCP parity), `agy` (Delegate a prompt directly to Antigravity CLI with bounded execution and shared job tracking), `audit-agent` (Agent auditor — audit Claude Code agent definitions for triggering accuracy, system prompt quality, tool appropriateness, and example…), `audit-command` (Command auditor — audit Claude Code slash commands for schema, workflow clarity, tool selection, error handling, and output…), `audit-fix` (Audit→fix→verify loop — finds issues, fixes them, verifies fixes, repeats until clean or you stop), `audit-nlp` (Repo-wide natural language programming auditor — discover and audit all NL artifacts (prompts, skills, agents, commands, rules, hooks,…), `audit-plugin` (Plugin auditor — audit Claude Code plugin artifacts for schema, specification, security, and structural defects), and 31 more\n- **Hooks** (3): `SessionStart`, `SessionEnd`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cc-suite@claude-community` from `xiaolai/cc-suite`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
